msgid ""
"Shelly's GUI needs <b>polkit</b> installed and running to authorize "
"privileged actions, but it wasn't found on the system bus.\n"
"\n"
"Install and enable it, then retry.\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"https://www.seafoam-labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/polkit/\">seafoam-"
"labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/polkit</a>"
msgstr "La interfaz gráfica de Shelly necesita <b>polkit</b> instalado y en ejecución para autorizar acciones privilegiadas, pero no se ha encontrado en el bus del sistema.\n\nInstálalo, actívalo y vuelve a intentarlo.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.seafoam-labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/polkit/\">seafoam-labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/polkit</a>"

